{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItems\">Inventory Items</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOnHand\">Qty on hand</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Current InventoryItem Is Item Location On Rent To ToDate\">The <strong>Quantity on Hand</strong> screen displays current <em>inventory levels</em> for a specific <em>inventory item</em> across all locations.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And HasWhere Is Location On To ToDate\">This screen helps you track where your inventory is stored and how much is available at each location.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Automatic Date InventoryTransfer InventoryTransfers InventoryWriteOff InventoryWriteOffs Invoice Invoices Off On PurchaseInvoice PurchaseInvoices Sales SalesInvoice SalesInvoices To ToDate Transaction Transactions Transfer Update WriteOff\">Inventory levels are automatically updated as you record transactions such as sales invoices, purchase invoices, inventory transfers, and inventory write-offs.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryLocation\">Inventory Location</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryLocation\">Inventory Location</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"HasWhere InventoryLocation Is Item Location Name On To ToDate\">Displays the name of each <em>inventory location</em> or warehouse where this item is stored.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Custom InventoryLocation InventoryLocations Location On To ToDate\">If you have not created custom <em>inventory locations</em>, the default location will be shown.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOnHand\">Qty on hand</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOnHand\">Qty on hand</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Current Location On Rent\">Shows the current <em>quantity on hand</em> at each location.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Location On To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">Click on any quantity to view all transactions that affected inventory levels at that specific location.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Location On To ToDate Total\">The total at the bottom shows the combined quantity across all locations.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "inventory-item-qty-on-hand"
}
